    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "To talk about a holiday",
     "texto": [
      "**As férias** = holidays. **Ir de férias** = to go on holiday. **Onde foste nas férias?** = where did you go on holiday?",
      "**A viagem** is «the trip», and it is feminine.",
      "**Lá** = there. **Todos os dias** = every day. **Foi ótimo!** = it was great!",
      "«Ver» in the past: **vi** (I saw), **viste** (you saw), **viu** (he / she saw)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
